{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>Modern Smart Plant</p>","expand":true,"uid":"c74f3991-c657-430b-b4c6-86ed9e7d59fb","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{}},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Latar Belakang</p>","generalization":null,"uid":"987e706c-f5ad-4166-83b5-29f012f24371","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>banyak pemilik tanaman yang tidak mengetahui tanaman membutuhkan air. Penyiraman yang terlalu sedikit dapat menyebabkan tanaman kekeringan, sedangkan penyiraman berlebihan dapat menyebabkan akar mengalami masalah</p>","uid":"09658eb3-3cf8-4c4a-80a7-f3ff74ba9928","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"customTextWidth":639},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Pengaruh Tanaman</p>","uid":"6cd10b94-0aa8-46e0-8f96-c16a2c3bb8fa","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Kelembaban Tanaman</p>","uid":"2ba1bf87-5394-4296-b99a-d78a240fd960","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Suhu Lingkungan</p>","uid":"f12da95f-8942-4a6c-9910-6a8369afc527","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Kelembaban Udara</p>","uid":"dc7c5037-7100-443f-8625-326d66dc3edf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Ketersediaan Air</p>","uid":"c2376197-c546-412e-9bb3-4a9b04775adf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Kondisi Tanah Tanaman</p>","uid":"9ad9e065-dc69-4b9c-a682-15c28296fd81","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Tujuan Project</p>","uid":"736488bc-a4fa-4ca7-945a-f50243c2e61a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Memantau kondisi lingkungan tanaman secara real-time</p>","uid":"e581e4f7-f2e0-46b4-9864-044b9ef6ef77","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Mendeteksi kondisi tanah terlalu kering atau terlalu basah</p>","uid":"2480f77a-da57-498b-8090-d83e8b683cd6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Mendeteksi suhu dan kelembapan lingkungan yang tidak ideal</p>","uid":"b1048d26-caab-46ff-8025-921651d2f1f8","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Melakukan penyiraman otomatis berdasarkan hasil analisis sensor</p>","uid":"99b45611-5162-4ae4-9aa0-925bea0bfa0c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Memberikan peringatan ketika kondisi tanaman membutuhkan perhatian</p>","uid":"93e7f4c3-443d-4030-8a8d-f0fc1ea5fde1","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Menyimpan riwayat pengukuran untuk analisis</p>","uid":"a967c622-2af4-48ce-993a-6483ebf4f4b5","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Menyediakan dashboard untuk monitoring dan kontrol jarak jauh</p>","uid":"81acc69d-37af-4ece-9da9-cb88af3e7749","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p><span>Fitur Aplikasi</span></p>","uid":"f11ac515-133d-46a7-a5a4-ba7990501d87","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"fontFamily":"微软雅黑, Microsoft YaHei","fontSize":18,"fontWeight":"normal","fontStyle":"normal","textDecoration":"none","color":"#fff","textAlign":"left","tagPlacement":"right","imgPlacement":"top","paddingX":15,"paddingY":5,"shape":"rectangle","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":10,"gradientStyle":false,"startColor":"#549688","endColor":"#fff","startDir":[0,0],"endDir":[1,0],"fillColor":"rgb(169, 218, 218)","borderColor":"rgb(30, 53, 86)","borderDasharray":"none","hoverRectColor":"","hoverRectRadius":5,"lineColor":"rgb(30, 53, 86)","lineDasharray":"none","lineWidth":2,"lineMarkerDir":"end","lineFlow":false,"lineFlowForward":true,"lineFlowDuration":1},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Monitoring Ekosistem Tanaman</p>","uid":"0c4a